# The five Learn lessons won by keys on a desktop window: hold Right and jump on a
# rhythm the rules tolerate at any phase (tools/plan.mjs checks the periods);
# each lesson's results, then Next → to the next lesson, the lesson list at the end.
# viewport 1280x800@1
until 600 Trickstep Tower
frames 30
click ▶ Play
until 300 Choose a Mode
frames 10
click =Learn: Play
until 300 Learn the Tower
frames 10
save tt-learn-list
click =Lesson 1 — Walking the Decks. Use Left/Right (or A/D, or the touch arrows) to walk. Reach the glowing exit door.
until 600 Lesson 1
frames 10
until 400 GO
frames 30
hold ArrowRight
repeat 3000 until Floor Cleared
key Space 1
frames 16
end
release ArrowRight
frames 10
expect Completion
save tt-learn-results
click =Next →
frames 10
until 600 Lesson 2
frames 10
until 400 GO
frames 30
hold ArrowRight
repeat 3000 until Floor Cleared
key Space 1
frames 16
end
release ArrowRight
frames 10
click =Next →
frames 10
until 600 Lesson 3
frames 10
until 400 GO
frames 30
hold ArrowRight
repeat 3000 until Floor Cleared
key Space 1
frames 16
end
release ArrowRight
frames 10
click =Next →
frames 10
until 600 Lesson 4
frames 10
until 400 GO
frames 30
hold ArrowRight
repeat 3000 until Floor Cleared
key Space 1
frames 16
end
release ArrowRight
frames 10
click =Next →
frames 10
until 600 Lesson 5
frames 10
until 400 GO
frames 30
hold ArrowRight
repeat 3000 until Floor Cleared
key Space 1
frames 25
end
release ArrowRight
frames 10
expect Total
click =Next →
until 300 Learn the Tower
frames 10
expect ★ Lesson 5
save tt-learn-done
